[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0010","text":"……\n蝉，在叫…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0020","text":"……？\n啊，真的呢。明明都到晚上了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0030","text":"……是啊\n为什么会叫呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0040","text":"可能是把日夜搞反了吧——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0041","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0050","text":"要把嘴SHHis上哦——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0051","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0060","text":"……你在说什么"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0070","text":"……唔\n对、对不起……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0080","text":"就，无意中造出来的词……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0090","text":"……会，会流行起来吗……说笑的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_12500100_02_0100","text":"……怎么说呢"}]
